WEBVTT

00:04:28.996 --> 00:04:31.871
What is human creativity, anyways?

00:04:32.079 --> 00:04:34.913
Is it something more than a system
of interconnected neurons

00:04:34.954 --> 00:04:37.663
developed by biological
algorithmic processes

00:04:37.704 --> 00:04:40.746
and the random experiences
that shape our lives,

00:04:40.788 --> 00:04:43.996
order and chaos,
machine and human?

00:04:44.579 --> 00:04:47.871
These are the dynamos at the heart
of machine creativity initiatives

00:04:47.913 --> 00:04:53.413
that are currently making music,
sculptures, paintings, poetry and more.

00:04:54.246 --> 00:04:55.746
The jury may still be out

00:04:55.788 --> 00:04:59.829
as to whether it's fair to call
these acts of creation creative.

00:04:59.871 --> 00:05:03.163
But if a piece of art can make you 
weep, or blow your mind,